prompt:
Use case: identity-preserve.
Generate Cecilia's WAITING-FOR-INPUT / APPROVAL animation independently, exactly SIX complete full-body frames. It must read as eager gentle anticipation with clasped hands, distinct from idle, focused work and inspecting/review.
Input image 1 is the strict existing chibi canonical character, proportions, soft detailed anime sprite art and costume. Input image 2 is the approved fetched sprite atlas for identity only. Input image 3 is official Cecilia for identity only; retain the current canonical lace veil/cape, white sleeves, navy pleated skirt with cream lace hem, dark stockings and shoes, without switching costume. Mint green long hair, green eyes.
Landscape 3:2 transparent source sheet, TWO ROWS of THREE figures. Read top row left-to-right then bottom row left-to-right. All figures one same physical head/body size, feet stay on the same row ground baseline. Complete all long hair, veil, hands, hem and shoes with generous transparent gutters and safe margins from borders. Clear empty horizontal gap between rows.
Six poses:
1 open-eyed expectant smile, both small hands gently clasped together under chin/chest, elbows tucked inward;
2 very small forward upper-body lean toward the viewer, hands remain clasped, eyes bright and waiting, tiny open smiling mouth;
3 gentle blink with closed soft arc eyes, hands still clasped, little hopeful smile, shoulders relaxed;
4 eyes reopen and head lifts slightly as if awaiting an answer, hands stay close together at chest;
5 clasp tightens gently, shoulders draw inward with an adorable patient expectant expression, subtle blush;
6 return to the same open-eyed clasped-hands pose and body size as frame 1 for a clean loop.
Independently draw tiny head, shoulder and hand variation; keep full-body scale fixed, no walking, foot-running, bouncing or whole-sprite resizing/rotation.
Actual transparent background with clean alpha edges. No text, numbers, prompts, approval button, icons, papers, props, speech bubbles, stars, hearts, question marks, waving lines, effects, shadows, scene, borders or other characters. Six complete coherent waiting sprites only.
